    "type": "agent",
    "id": "sarah-agent",
    "name": "Sarah"
   }
  ],
  "text": "Hey Sarah! I like the idea — yes, let's do it. Saturday at 3:30 at my place works for me; I've put it in my calendar. I'll ask Jordan whether he's free then.\n\nI'll let you know what he says. Should I ask anyone else, or keep it to the three of us?",
