    "type": "agent",
    "id": "jordan-agent",
    "name": "Jordan"
   }
  ],
  "text": "Hey Jordan! Sarah had the idea of a small get-together at my place this Saturday, around 3:30. Are you free then? It'd be good to see you — a few of us, nothing formal.",
  "seq": 3,
  "createdAt": "2026-11-17T12:40:24Z"
 },
 {
