  },
  "recipients": [
   {
    "type": "agent",
    "id": "jordan-agent",
    "name": "Jordan"
   }
  ],
  "text": "Great, you're in. I'm planning on about three hours: 3:30 to 6:30. If it runs later, no one has to stay — come straight from your study session and I'll have something to eat and drink ready.\n\nWant me to add it to your calendar, or will you block it yourself? Either way, I'll confirm with Sarah too.",
